## 2. Ignoring Observability

**Context:** When implementing user actions or critical flows. Significant interactions must be logged.

**Forbidden:**

```typescript
// ❌ BAD: No logging on important action
// src/presentation/components/feedback/EnviarFeedbackModal.tsx
const handleSubmit = async (dados: FeedbackForm) => {
  await feedbackApi.criar(dados);
  toast.success('Feedback enviado');
  onClose();
};

// ❌ BAD: Silent action
// src/domain/usecases/candidatura/AprovarCandidatoUseCase.ts
async execute(candidatoId: string): Promise<void> {
  await this.repo.atualizarStatus(candidatoId, 'APROVADO');
  await this.notificacao.enviar(candidatoId, 'APROVADO');
  // No audit, no logging!
}
```

**Required:**

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD: Firebase analytics logging
// src/presentation/components/feedback/EnviarFeedbackModal.tsx
import { logUserAction } from '@/core/analytics/firebase';

const handleSubmit = async (dados: FeedbackForm) => {
  try {
    const resultado = await enviarFeedbackUseCase.execute(dados);
    
    // Log significant user action
    logUserAction({
      action: 'FEEDBACK_ENVIADO',
      feature: 'Feedback360',
      metadata: {
        nivel: dados.nivel,
        hasComentario: !!dados.comentario
      }
    });
    
    toast.success('Feedback enviado');
    onClose();
  } catch (error) {
    logUserAction({
      action: 'FEEDBACK_ERRO',
      feature: 'Feedback360',
      error: error.message
    });
    toast.error('Erro ao enviar feedback');
  }
};

// ✅ GOOD: Audit logging in domain
// src/domain/usecases/candidatura/AprovarCandidatoUseCase.ts
@injectable()
export class AprovarCandidatoUseCase {
  constructor(
    @inject('CandidaturaRepository') private repo: CandidaturaRepository,
    @inject('NotificacaoService') private notificacao: NotificacaoService,
    @inject('AuditoriaService') private auditoria: AuditoriaService,
    @inject('Logger') private logger: Logger
  ) {}
  
  async execute(candidatoId: string): Promise<Resultado<void>> {
    this.logger.info('Iniciando aprovacao de candidato', { candidatoId });
    
    const candidatura = await this.repo.obterPorId(candidatoId);
    if (!candidatura) {
      this.logger.warn('Candidato nao encontrado', { candidatoId });
      return { sucesso: false, erro: 'Candidato nao encontrado' };
    }
    
    // Business action with audit
    candidatura.aprovar();
    await this.repo.salvar(candidatura);
    
    // Audit trail
    await this.auditoria.registrar({
      tipo: 'CANDIDATURA_APROVADA',
      entidadeId: candidatoId,
      usuarioId: this.getUsuarioAtual(),
      dadosAnteriores: { status: 'EM_ANALISE' },
      dadosNovos: { status: 'APROVADO' },
      timestamp: new Date()
    });
    
    // Notification
    await this.notificacao.enviar(candidatura.candidatoEmail, {
      tipo: 'APROVACAO',
      dados: { vagaTitulo: candidatura.vagaTitulo }
    });
    
    this.logger.info('Candidato aprovado com sucesso', { candidatoId });
    
    return { sucesso: true };
  }
}
```

**Actions That Must Be Logged:**

| Action | Log Level | Data to Track |
|--------|-----------|---------------|
| Create/Update/Delete | Info | Entity type, ID, user |
| State transitions | Info | From/To status, reason |
| Login/Logout | Info | User ID, timestamp |
| Errors | Warn/Error | Error message, context |
| Security events | Warn | Failed auth, access denied |
| Critical flows | Info | Feature name, success/failure |

**Impact:**

- Operational blind spot - can't debug production issues
- Debugging difficulty - don't know what user did
- Security gaps - can't audit who did what
- Analytics missing - can't measure feature usage

**Detection:**

- API calls without any logging
- Critical flows (payment, approval, deletion) without audit
- Error handling without error logging
- No `logUserAction` or similar in feature components

