## 5. Incorrect Loading Indicators

**Context:** When showing loading states. Must use DS Spinner component.

**Forbidden:**

```typescript
// ❌ BAD: Loader2 icon for loading
// src/presentation/components/vaga/VagasList.tsx
import { Loader2 } from 'lucide-react';

{loading && <Loader2 className="animate-spin" />}

// ❌ BAD: RefreshCw for loading
// src/presentation/components/candidatura/CandidatosTab.tsx
import { RefreshCw } from 'lucide-react';

{loading && <RefreshCw className="animate-spin" />}
```

**Required:**

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD: Spinner component from DS
// src/presentation/components/vaga/VagasList.tsx
import { Spinner } from '@/components/ui/spinner';

{loading && <Spinner size="md" />}

// ✅ GOOD: Full screen loading
// src/presentation/pages/recrutamento/GestaoVagas.tsx
import { Spinner } from '@/components/ui/spinner';

{loading && (
  <div className="flex justify-center items-center h-64">
    <Spinner size="lg" />
    <span className="ml-2 text-muted-foreground">Carregando vagas...</span>
  </div>
)}
```

**Spinner Sizes:**

| Size | Usage |
|------|-------|
| `sm` | Inline, buttons |
| `md` | Cards, lists |
| `lg` | Full page, modals |

**Impact:**

- UI inconsistent - different loading indicators
- Design System non-compliance
- User confusion - different spinners look like different states

**Detection:**

- `grep -r "Loader2\|RefreshCw" src/ --include="*.tsx"`
- Check imports from `lucide-react` for loading indicators

**Design System Reference:**

See `@DESIGN_SYSTEM_AUDIT.md` Section 1.2: "Loading corrigido (Loader2 -> Spinner)."

